# Byte-exact working tree everywhere.
#
# This repo vendors a pre-built SPA (LumoOS/lumo-dist/) whose scripts carry
# Subresource Integrity hashes: a single converted line ending breaks the hash
# and the app white-screens. Line-ending auto-conversion (core.autocrlf on
# Windows) must therefore never touch any tracked file. "-text" disables all
# EOL conversion in both directions; files are stored and checked out exactly
# as committed.
* -text
